      "privacyPolicy": {
        "enabled": true,
        "title": "SawDash — Privacy Policy",
        "content": "Privacy Policy for SawDash\n\nLast updated: September 2026\n\n1. Introduction\nThis Privacy Policy explains how SawDash ('the app', 'we', 'us') handles information. SawDash is developed and operated by an independent developer, contactable at viictoriaahiils@gmail.com. This policy applies to the SawDash Android and iOS app and covers what limited information the app stores, and what information our advertising provider (such as Google AdMob) may process when ads are shown.\n\n2. Information We Collect\nCollected by SawDash itself: None of your personal information is collected or transmitted by SawDash. The app stores your gameplay progress locally on your device only — highest stage reached, completed levels, coins, best scores/combos, unlocked characters/guns/backgrounds/animations, equipped items, settings (music/sound/vibration), and mission/achievement/daily-reward status. This data is saved to your device's local storage, never to a remote server, and the app has no mandatory account or sign-in system.\n\n3. Advertising & Analytics\nSawDash may use Google AdMob to display banner and rewarded video ads. The Google Mobile Ads SDK included in the app may collect information such as your device's advertising identifier, general device and operating-system information, IP address, coarse (non-precise) location derived from IP, and ad interaction/performance data.\n\n4. Rewarded Advertisements\nAfter losing lives in a level, you may voluntarily choose to watch a rewarded advertisement in exchange for an in-game reward — restoring lives and resuming that level. This is entirely optional and is never triggered automatically.\n\n5. Data Security & User Choices\nYour game progress is stored only on your own device. You can reset all locally-stored progress at any time from Settings -> Reset Progress, or clear the app's data through your device's app settings.\n\n6. Contact\nQuestions about this policy or SawDash's data practices can be sent to: viictoriaahiils@gmail.com.",
        "lastUpdated": "2026-09-07",
        "slug": "saw-dash-privacy"
      },
      "termsAndConditions": {
        "enabled": true,
        "title": "SawDash Terms & Conditions",
        "content": "Terms and Conditions for SawDash\n\n1. Acceptance of Terms\nBy downloading, installing, or playing SawDash, you agree to comply with these terms.\n\n2. License\nWe grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to play SawDash for personal, non-commercial entertainment.\n\n3. In-Game Assets & Coins\nIn-game coins, guns, lives, and upgrades earned through gameplay are virtual items with no real-world monetary value.\n\n4. Changes\nWe reserve the right to modify or update the game and these terms at any time.\n\n5. Contact\nFor any support or questions, please contact viictoriaahiils@gmail.com.",
        "lastUpdated": "2026-09-07",
        "slug": "saw-dash-terms"
      },
